# Lines 9, 11, 13, 15: inclusive two-sided bounds on the same X, either order,
# must fire. Line 17 (strict > <: InRange is inclusive), 19 (not the same X),
# 21 (or), 23 (different variable) must not.
# Known FP shape: X is not Integer/Int64/Double (Char, enum, string) where
# InRange has no overload; X with side effects (InRange evaluates it once).
manual-inrange 9
manual-inrange 11
manual-inrange 13
manual-inrange 15
!manual-inrange 17
!manual-inrange 19
!manual-inrange 21
!manual-inrange 23
